        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.13.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ist 13:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mïtokwa ECHOTYON Tororötïnkwa ntat koronini opetekwa ochengöy. Yonöy nyinte puntonichï chang. Choni kï: pipö Ititi nko Kirkasyi nko Amori nko Kanan nko Peris nko Ipiti nko Yepusi. Owesöch puntonichoni le mut nko odeny kïtïlakwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otini ketö ECHOTYON Tororötïnkwa chane morikwa apar chane kuwonyö lömïs. Mam mis nko chane amotöp ntosyonchï. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moyilchï tipikwo werkökwa amakany kwip werkökwo tipikwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ompöwölo wöghököy chane ato le asïyech monekwa kïtagh kïsagh ECHOTYON akïsagh tororötine walaka. Kïngwanit nyu ECHOTYON lakat ompö akwa, atökuwangakwa lawel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.12.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Krt 12:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenyona anganya ato kïpelo amöros arul pchörinekwa cho tïlilöch atörotör tororötïngwa Asyera* apel körkeyïntinekwa cho kipötöy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.19.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wuw 19:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.4.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Krt 4:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.14.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "14:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.26.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "26:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "TIT.2.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tit 2:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1PE.2.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1Pt 2:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agha lenyoni ompöwölo ochikwa pich cho tïlilöch ompö ECHOTYON Tororötïngwo. Kakïngotokwa nyinte alïkuna pikachi kegh, ompö kwenu puntoni walaka löwïr ompö ngwïny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Molenchï kegh kichamakwa ECHOTYON anta kïlakwa ompöwölo kyochikwa chang kïtïl piko walaka löwïr. Kyochikwa ngörï kïtïl pikö walaka löwïr. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo kigh ECHOTYON lenyoni, ompöwölo chömokwa akimököy kupuntoy kiyomisötenyi nyo kimwochï papotïnekwa. Nkanyoni tökumïtwakwa ECHOTYON ompö owesyenyi akïsörunenokwa kö pö sekeynön ompö mori Parao, pöytoghinto Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.20.5+EXO.20.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wuw 20:5-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.34.6+EXO.34.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "34:6-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.14.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kiy 14:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.5.9+DEU.5.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Krt 5:9-10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenyona onkïtï lö, ECHOTYON Tororötïnkwa kï Tororöt nyo ghanate. Komönöy nyinte mumenyi nko chomnyenyi nyo melö wöghöko ompö pich cho chömöy nyinte akïrïpöy kirurutkachi, ntökwitïta pïnwöy cho makïrar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo melö tomtomönöy nyinte kïghokyï pich nyarïl cho reyöy nyinte. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenyona oripö kirurutkachi löwïr cho omwowokwa asete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kisoyönut pö konyït",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.11.13+DEU.11.14+DEU.11.15+DEU.11.16+DEU.11.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Krt 11:13-17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ato alïmakwa kirurutchï arip nyoman, kïkomönöy nyu ECHOTYON Tororötïnkwa mumenyi nyo kyam nko akwa akuporwokwa chomnyenyi nyo möminye söröm le wölo kiyomisyï papotïnekwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kichamakwa akusoyönokwa akïtas yiyenkwa akusoyön parenikwa atonyorunö pagh nko dipay* nko mwowöyi arol, akïtas kyakikwa, ompö kor nyo kiyomisyï papotïnecho lö okonokwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisoyönokwa kïtïl pipö punton löwïr. Möminye kwenunkwa chi nyo le ngetat anta korka anta ompö kyakikwa nyo lïku sonö. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akïchengenokwa ECHOTYON kichïr anka tïkwïl. Melö konokwa sömewutchay ghach onkïtökwa pö koro Misri, wölo töni choni löwïr pungkökwa cho reyokwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awany nyu pich löwïr cho töni ECHOTYON Tororötïnkwa morikwa amakany kusyonok chane. Amopöghisyechï tororötinekwa, ompöwölo lïku ngöghöp choni ompö akwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mamwagh ompö mïkuliskökwo lö, ‘Chang puntonichï kïtïlecha. Mökimukechanye keyone.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maway chane. Anan lasiny kïgh nyo kighchï ECHOTYON Tororötïnkwa Parao nko pikachi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anana työmutchanye echön kyasïwekwa nko kiporut nko töngönchin nko owesyenyi nyo wow nyo kimïtunenokwa nyinte koro Misri. Kïlenyona ighchini ECHOTYON Tororötïnkwa lenyoni punton löwïr cho owöghekwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akï melö choni opïn, yonchini nyinte chane karam nyo kïrkegh kölentöy kïghïpchot kïtö kuwonyot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maway chane, ompöwölo mi ECHOTYON Tororötïnkwa nko akwa. Nyinte kï Tororöt nyo awes nyo pö otyogh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akïyonöy nyinte puntonichoni kukentoy kïngörï. Akïpar chane lawel, atömöchangit tïpö wudïn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Töni ECHOTYON Tororötïnkwa chane morikwa akïkwanykwany ntökewany chane lömïs ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akutö pöytoghi pïchoni morikwa. Opörekwa chane kuwonyö lömïs ompö ngwïny. Möminye chi nyo muköy kïmirokwa kegh, oporekwa chane lömïs. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apelekwa körkeyïntinekwa cho kipötöy. Mopïrchï ropïyen anta koltin cho kikïminchï körkeyïntinekwa atömölïkwï choni ngöghöp ompö akwa ompöwölo ghöchini ECHOTYON Tororötïnkwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Motö nyu korikwo körkeyïntinechoni, atömalïkwï pich cho chïpote. Atagha asas körkeyïntinechoni ompöwölo chïpote ompö ECHOTYON.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kor nyo karam nyo kïchengöy",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
